+load or store.  Owner, 2026-10-09: population 2 (the 26 header-named registers with no case) DECLINE + ANNOUNCE ONCE --
+reads served the preloaded word, writes dropped, one latched `fatal()` per register, `(once)`, `#501`'s shape.
